{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026r8xi31Yotk1793194536.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>俄羅斯成功試射了一枚潛射洲際彈道導彈。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.RUS.MISSILE-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Mg69qVzuZn1793194542.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>試射的是一枚布拉瓦洲際彈道導彈，平均射程超過8,000公里。俄羅斯國防部稱，一艘戰略核潛艇在鄂霍次克海從水底發射導彈，彈頭在預定時間成功抵達靶場指定區域。當局未有提及試射的具體時間。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T14:21:42.007919+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:58:17.568374+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T14:18:21.917923+00:00","content_hash":"e5775b5f7647adb31f15354bd556dfd02314d35d53a712e8e6f77ccdbbf0dc32","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T14:21:42.007919+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}